From 676c2a5b023d096675ba6a11f75652efdfeb47a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew de los Reyes <adlr@chromium.org>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 09:38:47 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 13/24] TILETEAR: MetaRenderTarget: add
 meta_render_target_get_output_frame()

Returns the extents covered by all of the render target's outputs
together, which is the size the framebuffer has to be. For a single
output that is just the CRTC mode size; for a tiled monitor it is the
full tiled size derived from the outputs' tile info.

No caller yet.
