From 4e56283581672edf8c049500ac3a0e1984d0191e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rubin Simons <me@rubin55.org>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 14:46:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 21/24] kms/impl-device: Waited for all tile CRTCs to flip
 before a commit

do_process() added the crtc_frame page flip listener for each CRTC of
the tile group, and the first flip event marked the frame ready. The
next commit could then reach a CRTC with a pending flip and fail with
EBUSY.

The listener is now added only on CRTCs that the commit touches, and
the frame is ready when the last of them has flipped. The main thread
can now post an update before the last CRTC flips, so
schedule_process() also commits a queued update when no deadline
timer is used and no flip is pending.

[adlr: use plain GPtrArray loops instead of meta_kms_crtc_ptr_array_foreach
 and meta_crtc_kms_ptr_array_get_primary, which this series removes]
---
 src/backends/native/meta-kms-impl-device.c | 94 +++++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 83 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/backends/native/meta-kms-impl-device.c b/src/backends/native/meta-kms-impl-device.c
